      "description": "Explore the first three days without saving a score.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-preview\" aria-label=\"Preview the first three days\"><span>Design preview</span><a href=\"#day1\" aria-current=\"page\">Pub</a><a href=\"#day2\">Beach</a><a href=\"#day3\">Fest</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-preview{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:18px;background:var(--sheet,#1d2a23);min-height:32px;font-family:Karla,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#aaa797)}.ds-preview a{color:var(--fg,#eee7d6);padding:5px 0;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:3px}.ds-preview a:hover{text-decoration-thickness:2px}.ds-preview a[aria-current]{color:var(--fg,#eee7d6);font-weight:700;text-decoration-color:var(--accent,#d9b874);text-decoration-thickness:2px}.ds-preview a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--fg,#eee7d6);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
